        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndūgū wa bbihī kūnema Luuzi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Boazi aho wīnga a henaho, ūja kū nzengo ūūkigaasha ha mita; lītabitile ikanza wiza ū ndūgū wa bbihī ūyo Boazi wang'hayaga. Ū Boazi ūng'wīla, “Alinzūgū wigaashe aha ong'wise.” Weegeela ho wigaasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Boazi witana banamhala ikūmi ba mu nzengo nabo ūbawīla, “Igaashagi aha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wandya kūng'wīla ū ndūgūye gīkī, “Ū Naomi ūyo washokile kūfuma Moabu alīlījinja nī lilaale īlo lyalī ya ndūgū wise Elimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naabona nakūmanīīkīje ū mhayo gwenūyū, hama nakūwīle ūlīgūle mu būtongi wa banhū aba bigaashaga aha, na mu būtongi wa banamhala ba banhū bane. Ūlū ūlītogwa ū kūlīkomoola gwītage ū mhayo gwenūyo, alīyo ūlū ūtūtogagwa, niwīlage nakūdeeba ū gwa kwīta, nguno ū mu būdūgū wise atīīko ūngī ūyo adūgije kūgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo ūlū ūtī bebe, na nene ū wa kūkūkūūbīja.” Ū ndūgū ng'wenūyo ūhaya, “Nakūlīkomoola.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Boazi ūhaya, “Ū lūshikū lwa kūlīgūla ī lilaale lya ng'wa Naomi, managa gīkī ūlīngūla nū Luuzi, ū nke wa sūmba ūyo wazumalīka, ūyo wazumalīka ūmūūkīje lina ū mu wingīji wakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ndūgū ng'wenūyo aho wigwa gīko ūlema alīhaya, “Ūlū chene ū nene yaya ū kūlīkomoola ī lilaale lyenīlo, natatogilwe kūkenaagūla wingīji wane; līkomolage ū bebe, ū nene natūūdūla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luuzi kūtoolwa na Boazi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī kale ū mu Baisilaeli, ī mihayo ya kūkomoola shikolo nūūlū kūkaabanya, yajaga gīkī, ū koolecha gīkī ū mhayo gwajaga gīt'ūmo shīmīle shilī, ūmò wa bigūlīji nūūlū abo bakwikaabīlaga shikolo, wazuulaga shilatū shakwe wang'winha ū ng'wiye. Ū mu Baisilaeli ū lwenūlo hū lwalī lūmeng'ho lwa koolecha gīkī ū mhayo gwenūyo gwanukūlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ndūgū ūyo yalī īng'wigeleelilwe kūlīkomoola ī lilaale ūng'wīla ū Boazi gīkī, “Līgūlage ū bebe lībize lyako;” hūna ūzuula shilatū shimò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Boazi ūbawīla a banamhala na a banhū a bangī gīkī, “Ī lelo yenīyī mulī bakaanīji ba gīkī naashigūla kūfuma ū kūlī Naomi pyī ī shikolo īsho shaalī sha ng'wa Elimeleki, Kilioni, na Mahiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū Luuzi ū muna Moabu, ūyo walī nke o ng'wa Mahiloni hū nangūlaga wabizaga wane, kūlwa kūlīlang'hana ī lina lyakwe ūyo wazumalīkile, likale līlīho ū mu wingīji wakwe; ī lina lyakwe lītizūjimīīla gete ū mu baana ba ng'wawe, nū mu mita gwa ng'wawe; ī lelo yenīyī ng'wabizaga bakaanīji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a banamhala na a banhū a bangī abo baalīho a ha mita būhaya, “Ng'hana tūlī bakaanīji. Ū Seeba ni ang'wītage ū nkīma ūyo aliza mu kaya yako abize gīt'ūmo baalī ba Laheli na Leya, abo kūlwa būbīlī wabo bakīzenga ī Isilaeli. Leka ūbize munhū wa ū mu Eflata, na munhū nkumūku ū mu Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seba akwīlūkīle ū kūfuma ū mu būbyīle ūbo alaakwinhe mu nzīla ya nshīke ūyo ataalī ndo ng'wenūyū. Ī kaya yako ībize gītī ya ng'wa Pelezi ūyo Tamali akamyaalīla Yuda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shibyalīlwe Sha Ng'wa Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Boazi ūntoola ū Luuzi, ūbiza nke wakwe; ū Seeba ūng'winha būdūla wa kūbūūcha nda, ūbyala ng'wana ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma būyūng'wīla ū Naomi gīkī, “Akumīlījiwe ū Seeba ūyo wakwinhaga ī lelo wa kūkūkomoola; ī lina lyakwe ni lībizage ikumūku hose pyī ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būpanga wako akūwinha nguzu mhya, nū mu shikū ja kū būgikūlū wako akūkūlang'hana; ū wei wabyalagwa na ng'wīnga wako ūyo akūtogilwe, ūyo alī wa mpango ntaale kūtinda bitūnja mpungatī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Naomi ūnsola ū nīgīnī ng'wenūyo ūbiza neji wakwe, na ūnang'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma abo baalī bazengile ng'wenūmo būhaya gīkī, “Ū Naomi wapandīkaga ng'wana ngosha;” būng'winha lina lya Obedi. Ū ng'wenūyo hū walī ise o ng'wa Yese, ūyo walī ise o ng'wa Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū īshi h'ī shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Pelezi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
